<title>USA: National Income nets $3.6 mln gain on sale.</title>
<headline>National Income nets $3.6 mln gain on sale.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Income Realty Trust said Monday it sold a 171,000-square-foot building in San Mateo, Calif., for $28.2 million, amounting to a gain of about $3.6 million, or $1.05 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to use the proceeds to reduce debt, repurchase up to three percent of its shares of beneficial interest and fund the construction of a 265-unit apartment complex.</p>
